  "title": "Harness Evolution in LLM Agents: A Behavior-Aware Framework",
  "summary": "This report outlines a framework for evaluating agentic learning capabilities by exploring how LLM agents adapt to diverse behaviors through a combination of behavior-awareness and co-evolution. It highlights key findings that indicate the importance of behavior in shaping the effectiveness of machine learning models.",
